          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"3-before-after-program\">3. Before / After Program</h2></span><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">WorldLoop does not ask a model to own global control flow. The derived v1 turns repeated failure structure into explicit retrieval operations.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='BYtC-0' random-id='c8cfe6d7-dd80-5660-6e86-6cd1ec46f19a'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;task shape&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;exact/control&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;program v0&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;exact&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;learned program v1&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;exact&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;added operation&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;none&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;task shape&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;freshness-sensitive&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;program v0&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;vector&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;learned program v1&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;vector -&#92;u003e temporal&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;added operation&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;temporal&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;task shape&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;cross-entity dependency&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;program v0&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;vector&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;learned program v1&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;vector -&#92;u003e graph&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;added operation&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;graph&#92;&quot;}]&quot;' data-total-rows='3' data-total-columns='4' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>What changed:</strong> freshness-sensitive tasks compile <code>temporal</code>; cross-entity tasks compile <code>graph</code>; exact-control tasks stay <code>exact</code>. The held-out evaluator, not this notebook, decides whether v1 is promoted.</span></span></div>"
